<Base title="Legal notice and privacy | Sven Mulfinger" description="Legal notice and privacy information for mulfinger.com.">
  <section class="container-x py-20 md:py-28">
    <div class="prose prose-neutral max-w-3xl">
      <h1 class="font-serif font-normal">Legal notice and privacy</h1>
      <p><em>Placeholder. Complete the details below and have them checked before launch.</em></p>

      <h2>Owner of this website</h2>
      <p>Sven Mulfinger<br />[Legal entity or sole trader details, NIF/CIF]<br />[Registered address], Barcelona, Spain<br />Contact: via the form on this site</p>

      <h2>Personal data</h2>
      <p>When you use the contact form, the data you enter (name, email, role, company and message) is used only to reply to your request and, if we work together, to manage that relationship. The legal basis is your consent and pre-contractual steps you request.</p>
      <p>Form submissions are stored by Netlify, Inc., our hosting provider, under standard contractual clauses. Data is kept for as long as needed to handle your request and is then deleted, unless a working relationship follows.</p>
      <p>You can ask to access, correct or delete your data, or object to its processing, at any time by writing via the contact form. You can also lodge a complaint with the Agencia Española de Protección de Datos (aepd.es).</p>

      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>This site does not use tracking or advertising cookies. Fonts are served from this domain, so no data is sent to third-party font services.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
